                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/292: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-06-28T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 28, 1928—3
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>208. Your 499, June 27, 7 p.m., Paragraph 2. Department approves your proposed
                    reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
